00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.200
Strongly consistent listings has
also been part of the product.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.350
So it doesn't matter
when you list,

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:56.920
when you upload a product,
when you upload objects.

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:58.970
As soon as you list
them, you'll be

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.870
