00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.890
to support Search,
YouTube, Gmail,

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:54.750
all the other big properties.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:59.520
And then, once you have all
these subsea cable investments

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:02.010
and points of presence
