00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:07.620
that's the ideal infrastructure
to build a public cloud

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.790
solution on top of.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.330
And so what you'll see
is that we actually

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.640
