00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:29.820
Osaka has just been announced--

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:30.630
Salt Lake City.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:33.510
So we have new regions
sprouting up everywhere,

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:39.230
all connected with very fast
