00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:42.380
The three primary use cases that
you'll see for Cloud Storage

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.480
are content storage
and delivery.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:46.527
And that leverages the
network that we just

00:03:46.527 --> 00:03:47.360
talked about, right?

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.000
How do you bring your objects
and make them available

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.730
globally with high performance?

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:55.430
Computing and analytics and
machine learning, of course,

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:57.680
are taking a great
